CM_ BO_ 8716355 "GN01 warning flags, it need to be cleared to \"Enable\" the power converter";
CM_ SG_ 8716355 V_B_HIGH "Warning: Port A voltage exceeds the maximum operating threshold";
CM_ SG_ 8716355 V_B_LOW "Warning: Port A voltage is below the minimum operating threshold";
