CM_ SG_ 8716355 V_DC_BELOW_AC "Warning: DC voltage measured is too low to generate AC voltage

                It needs to follow this equation::
                      Vset DC > VAC rms * sqrt(2) * 2 + 20
        ";
CM_ SG_ 8716355 V_SET_DC_BELOW_AC "Warning: DC voltage setpoint is lower than the measured AC voltage

                It needs to follow this equation::
                      Vset DC > VAC rms * sqrt(2) * 2 + 20
        ";
