CM_ SG_ 8716356 BLEEDING_DONE "Info: Bleeding process completed successfully";
CM_ BO_ 8716320 "The setpoints control the behaviour of the DC Port of the GN01. The GN01 operates this port in CVCC mode";
CM_ SG_ 8716320 Negative_Current_Limit "The maximum current that the GN01 will sink into the DC Port";
CM_ SG_ 8716320 Positive_Current_Limit "The maximum current that the GN01 will source on the DC Port";
CM_ SG_ 8716320 Voltage "Control the target dc side voltage. This voltage will be maintained as long as the current required to do so is smaller than the current limits specified in this message";
CM_ BO_ 8716321 "The setpoints that are currently used by the GN01. This message allows to validate that the setpoints have been properly applied.";
CM_ SG_ 8716321 Negative_Current_Limit "The maximum amount of current that the GN01 will sink into the DC port";
CM_ SG_ 8716321 Positive_Current_Limit "The maximum current that the GN01 will source on the DC Port";
CM_ SG_ 8716321 Voltage "The voltage target of the DC port";
